 months Senior Researcher at Universitat Pompeu Fabra (UPF), Department of Social and Political Sciences, Barcelona, Catalonia REF CALL: CPIS-PSR-2026-18 One 3 months Senior Researcher at Universitat Pompeu Fabra (UPF), Department of Social and Political Sciences, Barcelona, Catalonia REF CALL: CPIS-PSR-2026-18 One 3 months Senior Researcher at Universitat Pompeu Fabra (UPF), Department of Social and Political Sciences, Barcelona, Catalonia FRANCESCO MONCINI Modified 7 Days ago. REF CALL: CPIS-PSR-2026-18 One 3 months Senior Researcher at Universitat Pompeu Fabra (UPF), Department of Social and Political Sciences, Barcelona, Catalonia 10.09.2026 RRSS WhatsApp RRSS Bluesky RRSS Twitter RRSS Facebook RRSS email Copiar URL Position : CPIS-PSR-2026-18 Job Title : One 3 months Senior Researcher at Universitat Pompeu Fabra (UPF), Department of Social and Political Sciences, Barcelona, Catalonia Funding Source: ICREA Acadèmia. Official number reference: 2024 ICREA 00119 Research Line: Comportament polític, opinió pública i canvi climàtic Call 10th, September, 2026 Call Application Deadline 25th, September, 2026 Application and Documentation Selection Process 28th, September, 2026 05th, October, 2026 Provisional List of Admitted and Excluded Candidates Definitive List of Admitted and Excluded Candidates Provisional Proposal of Candidacy Multimedia Categories: SDG - Sustainable Development Goals: Els ODS a la UPF Contact Hidden Connect Contact Intranet Follow us © Universitat Pompeu Fabra Barcelona T.(+34) 93 542 20 00 Legal notice Accessibility Technical note We use cookies to deliver personalized content, analyze trends, administer the site, track user movements on the site, and collect demographic information about our user base as a whole. Accept all cookies for the best possible experience on our website or manage your preferences. Legal notice Configuration Accept All Decline All"
